{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "ואתן אותם ראשים", :translit "v'eten otam rashim", :gloss "and I set them as heads"} {:he "אותם", :translit "otam", :gloss "them"} {:he "מלא וי\"ו", :translit "malei vav", :gloss "plene with vav"} {:he "בפ' הנחנקין", :translit "b'perek ha-henekin", :gloss "in the chapter of those strangled"} {:he "איזה הוא בן עוה\"ב", :translit "eizeh hu ben olam ha-ba", :gloss "who is a son of the World to Come"} {:he "כל מי שהוא שפל ברך ענותן שייף ועייל שייף ונפיק גריס באורייתא תדירא ולא מחזיק טיבותא לנפשיה", :translit "kol mi she-hu shfal berech, anatan, shayif v'ayil, shayif v'nafik, garis b'oraita tadira, v'lo machzik tivuta l'nafshei", :gloss "anyone who is humble of knee, humble, enters gently, exits gently, grinds in Torah constantly, and does not attribute merit to himself"} {:he "שרי אלפים ושרי מאות ושרי חמשים ושרי עשרות", :translit "sarei alafim u-sarei me'ot u-sarei chamishim u-sarei asarot", :gloss "officers of thousands and officers of hundreds and officers of fifties and officers of tens"} {:he "ד\"פ שרי", :translit "da'at pei sarei", :gloss "four forms of officers of"} {:he "כנגד ד' דגלים", :translit "k'neged dalet degalim", :gloss "corresponding to four banners"} {:he "ושוטרים לשבטיכם ואצוה", :translit "v'shoterim l'shvateichem v'atzveh", :gloss "and officers for your tribes and I will charge"} {:he "רמז למקל ורצועה", :translit "remez l'makel v'ratzua", :gloss "an allusion to rod and strap"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "אותם written plene with vav — the extra letter yields six traits"} {:kind :other, :note "Four forms of 'שרי' (officers of) correspond to the four banners of Israel's wilderness camp"}], :frame {:text "The Mishnah lists traits of one who is a son of the World to Come in Sanhedrin 10:1, a passage discussed in the Talmudic chapter of those strangled (Sanhedrin 90a–99a). The four banners — Judah, Reuben, Ephraim, Dan — are the wilderness camp divisions in Numbers 2.", :sources ["Mishnah Sanhedrin 10:1" "Numbers 2"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :other, :note "אותם written plene with vav — the extra letter yields six traits", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Four forms of 'שרי' (officers of) correspond to the four banners of Israel's wilderness camp", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:33:29.949927106Z", :model "glm-5.2"}